{"title": "[情報] 今日Kessler 26分 12投12中 10灌", "author": "pneumo (超☆冒險蓋)", "board": "", "date": "Thu Oct 22 12:41:28 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1792644090.A.6ED.html", "body": "來源：NBA BOX/StatMuse/ 湖人記者Khobi Price\n網址：\nhttps://www.nba.com/game/gsw-vs-lal-0022600005/box-score\n\nhttps://www.statmuse.com/nba/ask/highest-scoring-games-by-walker-kessler\n\nhttps://x.com/khobi_price/status/2113117219639185712\n\nhttps://x.com/khobi_price/status/2113125675268014184\n\n今日凱子樂\n\n26分 (生涯第2高，最高是31分)\n\n12投12中 (10灌)\n\n這是Kessler生涯第五場命中率100%的比賽，也是出手最多次的。先前四場數據是：\n\n   日期     得分   對手   出手\n2025-10-22  22分   快艇    7/7\n2025-02-26  25分   國王   10/10\n2025-02-12  16分   湖人    8/8\n2022-12-02  20分   溜馬    7/7\n(以上皆在爵士時期)\n\nWalker Kessler's 10 dunks are the most by a Laker since Shaq in 2003, per\nESPN.\n\n根據ESPN，Kessler今天場上的10灌是在2003年Shaq之後最多的湖人球員。\n\nOnly Wilt Chamberlain (34 points on 14-14 shooting on 3/11/69) has achieved a\nperfect shooting night on at least 12-12 shooting in franchise history.\n\n湖人隊史上，只有大帥張伯倫(34分，14投14中)比今天Kessler的12投12中完美命中率\n\n進的多。\n\n----\n\nhttps://i.meee.com.tw/6E9v46r.jpg", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "ZILY123", "content": "強阿", "time": "10/22 12:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "K951753", "content": "LUKA要得中鋒 真的好強", "time": "10/22 12:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "wii128", "content": "凱尼爾", "time": "10/22 12:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hua0122", "content": "勇士又創紀錄了 大中鋒肆虐", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "kenbo", "content": "樓下五個字說出來", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "alan5232000", "content": "凱尼爾", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Aggro", "content": "猛", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "a1773042", "content": "真香", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "shellback", "content": "77終於盼到懂吃餅的中鋒", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "joystation", "content": "有77吸怪，大中鋒就是可以打的很舒服", "time": "10/22 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "kenny0120", "content": "凱尼爾 我還有點餓", "time": "10/22 12:42"}